    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Red beets are&nbsp;vibrant root vegetables known for their deep red color, earthy flavor, and potential health benefits.&nbsp;They are a good source of vitamins A and C, folate, calcium, and fiber, as well as antioxidants like betalains.&nbsp;Beets can be enjoyed raw, roasted, boiled, or juiced, and even their leaves are edible.&nbsp;</span></p>",
